      "text": "Small slide\nHigh vantage point lookout\nfor easier finding your toy\nbut exposed you easy",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "4CwKUiL-7IR6-B0DXng9Q",
      "originalText": "Small slide\nHigh vantage point lookout for easier finding your toy but exposed you easy",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "05HFoNZL3yJWJgJvHbH0n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -792.365889936139,
      "y": 944.7386471736968,
      "width": 2152.127197265625,
      "height": 636.9705876158631,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 659697403,
      "version": 1079,
      "versionNonce": 798820277,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768306832092,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Abilities:\n*Loud toy: This makes sound and lures the caretakers to it. It has a radius of about in this\nscale of 5 squares (or 5 meters) and will only lure the closest caretaker to its location.\nOnce the caretaker gets to the toy they will pick it up and fiddle with it to turn it off.\nThis will take 3 seconds during which time they will no longer notice anything around them.\n\n*Armors arrow: Can be used to shoot at a caretaker who then will run to the first other caretaker\nthey see and talk with them distracting both for 2 seconds or if both get shot they will be distracted\nfor 6 seconds. (Very strong will have few arrows to balance)\n\n*Baby powder: Can be used similar to a smoke bomb will obstruct the view of both the caretaker and \nthe player in an 3 meter circle area for 3 seconds.",
      "fontSize": 42.464705841057544,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Abilities:\n*Loud toy: This makes sound and lures the caretakers to it. It has a radius of about in this\nscale of 5 squares (or 5 meters) and will only lure the closest caretaker to its location.\nOnce the caretaker gets to the toy they will pick it up and fiddle with it to turn it off.\nThis will take 3 seconds during which time they will no longer notice anything around them.\n\n*Armors arrow: Can be used to shoot at a caretaker who then will run to the first other caretaker\nthey see and talk with them distracting both for 2 seconds or if both get shot they will be distracted\nfor 6 seconds. (Very strong will have few arrows to balance)\n\n*Baby powder: Can be used similar to a smoke bomb will obstruct the view of both the caretaker and \nthe player in an 3 meter circle area for 3 seconds.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Nnb1UwkQsl0l0R9FROF1c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -790.6376703836593,
      "y": 1776.2064692801275,
      "width": 2136.78662109375,
      "height": 944.9562582406762,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1465982875,
      "version": 1544,
      "versionNonce": 1655438645,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768249301172,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Puzzle:\nMatchmaker.\nAfter you notice that you are playing cupid and get your powers you feel the need to do your job again\nyou want to make the perfect couples for the caretakers. To do so you need to sneak around in their \nwork and pause area to find out information about them and their preferences. To make them all match.\n\nExample:\nBob is tall and has brown hair - his perfect partner would be short with blond hair\nKevin is tall and has brown hair - his perfect partner would be tall with red hair\n\nSara is short and has blond hair - her perfect partner would be tall with brown hair\nLisa is tall and has red hair - her perfect partner would be tall with brown hair\n\nIf we were to see only the girls preferences it would be impossible but with the info of the others\nwe can make two perfect matches Sara with Bob and Lisa with Kevin.\n\nThe info can be found in the map near the lockers or the kitchen but it can also be heard \nwhen the caretakers talk.",
      "fontSize": 41.99805592180783,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Puzzle:\nMatchmaker.\nAfter you notice that you are playing cupid and get your powers you feel the need to do your job again\nyou want to make the perfect couples for the caretakers. To do so you need to sneak around in their \nwork and pause area to find out information about them and their preferences. To make them all match.\n\nExample:\nBob is tall and has brown hair - his perfect partner would be short with blond hair\nKevin is tall and has brown hair - his perfect partner would be tall with red hair\n\nSara is short and has blond hair - her perfect partner would be tall with brown hair\nLisa is tall and has red hair - her perfect partner would be tall with brown hair\n\nIf we were to see only the girls preferences it would be impossible but with the info of the others\nwe can make two perfect matches Sara with Bob and Lisa with Kevin.\n\nThe info can be found in the map near the lockers or the kitchen but it can also be heard \nwhen the caretakers talk.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
